        "note": "Supplies the statement: Kim Morrison's lean-eval problem darboux (added 25 May 2026; Copyright 2026 Lean FRO, LLC, Apache 2.0). Challenge.lean copies its ChallengeDeps.lean and Challenge.lean apart from the module header, @[expose] public section, moving the definitions into one file, and term proofs in place of omega for the bounds in idxP and idxQ (see fidelity); scripts/check-lean-eval-match.py checks this. lean-eval's v1 audit of 20 Aug 2026 records four accepted solutions from four users, the first on 17 Jun 2026; I found none of them published, and this entry does not use them.",
