        "note": "MorseFloer.Darboux.darboux (16 Sep 2026), in a formalization of Audin and Damian's Morse Theory and Floer Homology: by Moser's method, a C^1 closed form on a finite-dimensional real space, non-degenerate at a point, is near that point the pullback of its constant value there. A different statement from lean-eval's (no standard form, no EuclideanSpace R (Fin (2n))). Not used here.",
